<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR RISES TO $59-1/4 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR RISES TO $59-1/4 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened flat at $58-7/8 in New York on Thursday, but soon rose to $59-1/4, up $0-3/8</p>
<p>The latter price corresponds to about 305.46 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
